    "description": "CORRECTION to EXP-002. EXP-002 tested form_compact ADDED on top of the existing raw multi-window \"form\" group (groups = strength+form+history+context+form_compact), not form_compact REPLACING it as the experiment description and the task phrasing (\"test smaller, better-defined form representations\", implicitly instead of the noisy ones) both intended. This is the corrected REPLACE variant: groups = strength+form_compact+history+context (raw \"form\" group removed).",
